+== Remote OTA ==
+
+With `ota_config` enabled, a node also accepts a signed `OTA_UPDATE` command on
+`flexcloud/<connectorID>/<applicationID>/cmd` (sent by the flexEngineV2 `arduino-ota`
+driver; format and signature as flexCommunicator's `compose_command`, key =
+`appDescriptor_config`'s flexCloud secret key). It downloads the image named in the
+command, checks its size and sha256, installs it and restarts; a failed step leaves the
+current firmware running. Progress is written to `<connectorID>:applications:<applicationID>:ota`,
+a heartbeat to `...:heartbeat` every `FLEXNODE_HEARTBEAT_S` (5) seconds. The Portenta
+bootloader checks no signature: only commands signed with the node key are executed, so
+keep that key secret. See `examples/features/otaRemote`.
+
 
 For more information about this library please contact us
 Bert.VanAcker@uantwerp.be
